{
  "format": "zapterm-command-lists",
  "version": 1,
  "platform": "arista_eos",
  "notes": "Arista EOS command lists. Every command below was checked against the Arista EOS 4.37.0F User Manual on arista.com (its command syntax or a documented example) — nothing was added from memory. Chapters: Command-Line Interface, Switch Administration Commands, Environment Commands, Ethernet Ports, Port Channels and LACP, Multi-Chassis Link Aggregation, Spanning Tree Protocol, LLDP, VLANs, IPv4, ACLs and Route Maps, VRRP and VARP, BFD, OSPFv2, BGP and VXLAN Commands. Left out: commands not found there (MAC address table, inventory, processes, debugs, tcpdump…) and commands that reload or erase the switch.",
  "label": "Arista EOS",
  "stopDebug": [],
  "lists": [
    {
